 "text": "Hey! How's everything going? Lots of things. Do they like cooking? You could do a shared dinner together, they could show you their favourite recipes. Ask him to tell you one every evening. It' a lovely way to spend time and he'll treasure it. Ask them beforehand what they never eat and won't try. Then find a dish without it. There's lots of keto and low carb recipes out there. Maybe not. Ask them instead about their favourite cake or biscuit memory.",
